    "field": "Climate change economics",
    "problem": "Existing economic models and global risk assessments fail to incorporate the immense financial costs of Arctic warming, particularly methane release from permafrost, leading to a severe underestimation of the worldwide economic threat.",
    "method": "The authors propose using the PAGE09 integrated assessment model to quantify the economic cost of methane release from thawing Arctic permafrost by superposing a methane pulse onto standard emissions scenarios to calculate the resulting net present value of global climate impacts.",
    "task": "The task is to quantify the global economic impacts of a large-scale methane release from thawing Arctic permafrost using an integrated assessment model.",
